    "description": "<p>A pair of padded gloves provides extra hitting power thanks to their weight and the materials used to construct them. Anyone who expects to get into a fistfight or a brawl probably wants to wear Combat Gloves. They provide a +1 bonus to damage on a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed Attack\">Unarmed Attack</a>. </p><p>Combat Gloves are two sizes smaller than their wearer (for example, a pair of Combat Gloves designed for a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a> are Tiny). Because of how they are worn, Combat Gloves can't be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disarmed\">Disarmed</a> or dropped. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Small_Combat_Gloves\">Small Combat Gloves</span></h3><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Medium_Combat_Gloves\">Medium Combat Gloves</span></h3>",
